# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this, `web/node_modules` (hundreds of MB, built for the host) is
# copied into the image and can overwrite the container's freshly installed
# dependencies. It also leaked into the build as 0444 and made the vite binary
# non-executable, so `npm run build` failed with "vite: Permission denied".

# --- version control & tooling ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.vscode
.idea

# --- secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
deploy/k8s/secret.yaml

# --- node ---
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
web/coverage
**/node_modules
**/dist

# --- python ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
.venv
venv

# --- generated data, weights, run artefacts ---
ml/data/generated
ml/checkpoints
ml/runs
ml/notebooks/*.ipynb
data
*.faiss
faiss_index*/
*.pt
*.onnx
*.safetensors

# --- local runtime ---
/tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
